  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GIS based spatial overview of the Grootvlei catchment area</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of this project is to create a GIS-based (Geographic Information System) spatial overview of the Grootvlei catchment area. This must visualise land ownership, land use, infrastructure, and ecological features. This is required in order to be able to set next crucial steps in the Grootvlei Combi-Track programme, in relation to, amongst others, the development of the agrihub, the identification of economic drivers and restauration of wetlands.</narrative>
  </description>
